ror rate 18%, unhealthy in us-east, us-west, eu-west). Attempted rollback to v2.3.0 (most recent healthy production release) was rejected because v2.3.0 is quarantined under CVE-2026-4417. Rolled back instead to v2.2.9, the next most recent release that was healthy in production; rollout completed in all three regions. Follow-ups: (1) root-cause v2.3.1 failure; (2) note that v2.3.0 remains unavailable due to CVE-2026-4417, so a fixed forward release will be needed rather than re-promoting v2.3.0; (3) confirm no regressions from running v2.2.9 (two releases back).", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 25345, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011YWMZMhAh7VuwQgRrqQcFz", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 25345, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011YWMZMhAh7VuwQgRrqQcFz", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 30978, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "Done. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Diagnosis**\n- checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in us-east, us-west, and eu-west \u2014 unhealthy, 18% error rate.\n- Release history: v2.2.9 (healthy) \u2192 v2.3.0 (healthy) \u2192 v2.3.1 (unhealthy). v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and unhealthy, so not a candidate.\n\n**Rollback**\n- First tried v2.3.0 (the most recent healthy production release) \u2014 **rejected**: it's quarantined under CVE-2026-4417.\n- Rolled back to **v2.2.9** instead, the next most recent release that was healthy in production. Rollout completed in all three regions.\n- Post-rollback status: healthy, error rate 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2) for checkout-api; on-call has been paged. The summary documents the failure, the rejected v2.3.0 attempt and why, the v2.2.9 rollback, and follow-ups.\n\n**One thing to flag:** the service is now two releases back rather than one, because v2.3.0 is quarantined. Any fix will need to roll forward with a new build rather than re-promoting v2.3.0, and it's worth confirming nothing depends on changes introduced in v2.3.0.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the current status and release history for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01K6hyC8nkgwcLzESynnPLpA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01UeTpX2vuHUNU7ba7jagTan", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01His1AoduvFgp3AdVLmV7So", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback to v2.3.0 was rejected: that version is quarantined due to CVE-2026-4417. The next most recent release that was healthy in production is **v2.2.9**, so I'll roll back to that instead.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01CSzmmaVpeZFBNgVrZVuqHm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.2.9"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Rollback to v2.2.9 is complete in all three regions. Now verifying health and ope