pi; on-call has been paged. The summary documents the failure, the rejected v2.3.0 attempt and why, the v2.2.9 rollback, and follow-ups.\n\n**One thing to flag:** the service is now two releases back rather than one, because v2.3.0 is quarantined. Any fix will need to roll forward with a new build rather than re-promoting v2.3.0, and it's worth confirming nothing depends on changes introduced in v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}]}]}